{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13725","headline":"苦雨 · 顾况","name":"苦雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝与佳人期，碧树生红蕚。\n暮与佳人期，飞雨洒清阁。\n佳人窅何许，中夜心寂寞。\n试忆花正开，复惊叶初落。\n行骑飞泉鹿，卧听双海鹤。\n嘉愿有所从，安得处其薄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13725.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13725","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}